+**Pseudocode:**
+```python
+def greedy_merge_vv(probabilities, W):
+    # Build full binary tree of depth W
+    tree = _build_full_tree(W, probabilities)
+    while _longest_code_length(tree) < W:
+        l_min = _find_min_weight_leaf(tree)
+        p = l_min.parent
+        # Prune children, convert p to leaf with combined weight
+        p.weight = p.left.weight + p.right.weight
+        p.left = None
+        p.right = None
+        p.is_leaf = True
+    return tree
+```
 
